% Habits: consistency, Anki, to-do adherence.
\p{It is a humbling reality that my habits fell off a cliff this week. The only thing to do is to try my best to get back on the wagon. There is a silver lining here. Through tracking, I can see that there is too much friction in these habits right now. For example, my stretch routine has gotten to 28min! Obviously, we will be cutting this down until we become consistent again. For Anki, I am already back on the wagon, and I do not think it will be a problem.}
